## 1. Development objective and AI usage

The challenge is to build a local, reproducible pipeline that ingests heterogeneous product feeds from multiple suppliers, validates the data, standardizes schemas and values, resolves competing offers into one golden product per identity, quarantines invalid records, maintains lineage and audit logs, and demonstrates idempotency and reconciliation.

Our approach used AI as a technical collaborator to: (1) convert the problem statement into engineering requirements, (2) prioritize deliverables, (3) propose a modular architecture, (4) generate and review Python/SQL implementation, (5) formulate tests and validation commands, and (6) prepare a repository for review. The candidate executed the commands locally, inspected results, and remains responsible for verifying the submitted code.

